WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:03.480
<i>Grandma, how are you doing?</i>

00:03.480 --> 00:05.540
<i>I'm doing great!</i>

00:07.900 --> 00:10.140
<i>It's the second half of our second year,</i>

00:10.140 --> 00:12.450
<i>and I've made a lot of 
progress with my magic.</i>

00:12.890 --> 00:18.520
<i>I even exchanged the magic stones I got 
in a dungeon for a new magic tool.</i>

00:19.300 --> 00:23.000
<i>Thanks to the help of those around 
me, I'm actually getting by.</i>

00:34.270 --> 00:36.630
<i>I can't talk about it in detail yet,</i>

00:37.000 --> 00:38.960
<i>but my friends and I plan to work together</i>

00:38.960 --> 00:41.470
<i>and do our best to help 
a whole lot of people.</i>

00:42.700 --> 00:45.770
<i>Looks like Alicia and her 
friends are leveling up nicely.</i>

01:11.360 --> 01:14.920
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

01:11.730 --> 01:14.920
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

02:20.570 --> 02:23.790
Pardon me. Are you Miss Yumiella Dolkness?

02:23.790 --> 02:24.990
Yes, I am.

02:25.260 --> 02:28.750
I'm from the kingdom's magic 
tool development team.

02:28.750 --> 02:31.240
I'd like you to assist with an experiment.

02:32.850 --> 02:35.300
I've gotten the principal's 
permission to do this.

02:35.300 --> 02:37.760
We're free to use this room as we please.

02:40.870 --> 02:44.260
This is our latest model 
of magic-sealing shackles.

02:44.790 --> 02:48.020
I'd like to see if they 
can hold up to your magic.

02:48.020 --> 02:50.620
So now I just need to use my magic?

02:50.620 --> 02:53.940
Yes. Raise the output gradually, please.

02:55.100 --> 02:56.280
All right.

03:09.830 --> 03:11.570
That was my full strength.

03:11.570 --> 03:14.170
This is an impressive magic tool.

03:14.170 --> 03:15.290
All right, now!

03:17.300 --> 03:19.800
Let's kill her quick and get out of here!

03:20.050 --> 03:22.590
That stuff about a magic tool 
experiment was all a lie!

03:22.590 --> 03:25.510
I never thought you'd 
fall for it that easily!

03:29.140 --> 03:30.430
Huh?

03:31.030 --> 03:34.180
My physical strength is also level 99.

03:35.190 --> 03:37.410
I-It was just a joke!

03:37.410 --> 03:40.190
I appreciate your assistance 
with our experiment.

03:40.190 --> 03:42.650
Do you really think that's going to fly?

03:46.380 --> 03:49.830
Pretty dumb idea they had, 
going after you like that.

03:50.140 --> 03:52.140
Who do you think they were?

03:52.140 --> 03:53.210
I don't know.

03:53.420 --> 03:57.460
Maybe it's a scheme by Remlest 
or some other country?

03:57.680 --> 04:01.820
In any case, someone in the 
school must have led them here.

04:01.820 --> 04:04.380
It wouldn't hurt to be extra careful.

04:05.010 --> 04:06.350
All right.

04:07.830 --> 04:09.470
<i>Two days later, overnight...</i>

04:17.790 --> 04:18.650
Huh?

04:18.950 --> 04:22.420
Um... You're some sort 
of assassin, aren't you?

04:24.820 --> 04:30.120
I've been nearly assassinated twice now. 
You should probably stay away from me.

04:31.630 --> 04:33.530
What's wrong, Patrick?

04:33.970 --> 04:36.170
You're really okay with that?

04:36.170 --> 04:39.570
Huh? I'm just fine, as you can see.

04:39.570 --> 04:42.310
I'm not worried about you dying,

04:42.310 --> 04:47.140
but how can you be okay knowing 
someone wants to kill you?

04:47.140 --> 04:51.890
<i>He's right. Somewhere deep inside, 
I might be a little hurt.</i>

04:51.890 --> 04:54.690
<i>But the way it felt when they attacked...</i>

04:54.690 --> 04:57.060
<i>I feel like I've experienced 
it many times before...</i>

04:57.060 --> 04:59.320
You should stay with me for a while.

04:59.320 --> 05:01.320
There's nothing you need to worry—

05:02.440 --> 05:05.080
It's the feeling I get 
when fighting monsters.

05:05.080 --> 05:06.200
Monsters?

05:06.630 --> 05:09.920
It's kill or be killed when 
fighting monsters too, right?

05:09.920 --> 05:12.450
I guess I'm used to that sort of thing.

05:12.770 --> 05:14.660
Uh, monsters and people aren't the—

05:15.710 --> 05:16.210
Watch out!

05:20.420 --> 05:23.530
I'll go catch who did this. You hide!

05:24.010 --> 05:25.170
Yumiella!

05:29.250 --> 05:32.310
You'll pay for that. Targeting 
me alone is one thing,

05:32.890 --> 05:35.530
but what if you had hit Patrick?

05:40.060 --> 05:44.270
If I stay at school, I'll put Patrick 
and the other students in danger.

05:47.100 --> 05:48.860
Let's go, Demon Lord!

05:50.030 --> 05:51.450
Bring it on, hero!

05:51.450 --> 05:52.810
We're gonna turn the tables!

05:52.810 --> 05:53.700
Yah!

05:54.670 --> 05:56.380
I will not lose!

05:58.030 --> 06:02.170
<i>In this kingdom, people are detested 
just for having dark hair.</i>

06:02.170 --> 06:04.870
<i>It happened to me when I 
started at the academy, too.</i>

06:05.590 --> 06:08.100
<i>Then I had people doubting my level,</i>

06:08.100 --> 06:10.110
<i>and rumors that I was the Demon Lord.</i>

06:10.430 --> 06:13.100
<i>At that point, I don't think it 
was about my hair color anymore.</i>

06:14.570 --> 06:16.350
You're not going to play with the others?

06:16.350 --> 06:18.510
Huh? Who are you?

06:18.510 --> 06:20.200
Just a passerby.

06:20.200 --> 06:23.020
What's wrong? Are they leaving you out?

06:23.020 --> 06:25.080
It's not that... It's just...

06:25.080 --> 06:28.140
You know, since my hair looks like this...

06:29.880 --> 06:30.850
Look.

06:31.800 --> 06:34.870
As you can see, my hair is black as night.

06:34.870 --> 06:36.930
But I have friends,

06:36.930 --> 06:39.870
and recently, I've been finding 
more people I can talk to.

06:40.910 --> 06:43.350
Everyone avoided me at first,

06:43.350 --> 06:47.610
but little but little,
the distance has been closing.

06:47.610 --> 06:48.880
That's really cool.

06:49.110 --> 06:52.530
I don't have the guts to try 
to make friends, though.

06:52.530 --> 06:56.390
I'm the same way. Mine spoke to me first.

06:56.790 --> 07:00.680
I had half given up on 
getting close to anyone.

07:01.970 --> 07:06.270
But if I had tried to approach people myself,

07:06.270 --> 07:09.060
maybe it wouldn't have taken so long.

07:09.530 --> 07:11.910
Yeah, maybe... but...

07:13.230 --> 07:14.530
Hey there, miss.

07:14.530 --> 07:16.830
Yumiella Dolkness, right?

07:18.200 --> 07:19.410
Huh? What is it?

07:19.410 --> 07:20.410
Hey!

07:23.790 --> 07:25.420
Get away, all of you. It's dangerous.

07:25.710 --> 07:28.420
Enough of this! We'll all go for her at once!

07:32.180 --> 07:33.260
Dark Bind.

07:36.640 --> 07:37.710
Wow, cool!

07:37.710 --> 07:38.620
What was that?

07:38.620 --> 07:39.770
Are you a mage?

07:40.090 --> 07:41.890
So you're the leader of this group?

07:41.890 --> 07:44.020
Who sent you after me?

07:44.020 --> 07:45.770
H-Hell if I know!

07:45.770 --> 07:47.290
Understood.

07:47.290 --> 07:50.900
A show of cruelty here would set 
a bad example for the kids...

07:51.240 --> 07:53.910
so why don't we take our 
time talking over there?

07:54.120 --> 07:58.630
I seriously don't know! Some guy 
hiding his face paid me to do this!

07:58.630 --> 08:01.540
I'm not lying! Please believe me!

08:01.880 --> 08:03.780
She's a real mage!

08:03.780 --> 08:05.110
I've never seen one before!

08:05.110 --> 08:06.820
Who was that lady?

08:06.820 --> 08:09.610
I don't know, but... she's so cool!

08:09.610 --> 08:12.050
Yeah, she is!

08:12.840 --> 08:14.940
And what happened after that?

08:14.940 --> 08:18.930
I tried threatening him a little, but 
he really didn't seem to know anything.

08:19.140 --> 08:22.560
So I handed him over to the nearest 
soldiers, as usual, and that was it.

08:25.390 --> 08:28.690
Hey, Rita... Are these the same 
tea leaves you always use?

08:29.100 --> 08:32.570
Yes. They're the same ones as always.

08:32.570 --> 08:34.980
I see. Maybe I imagined it.

08:35.560 --> 08:37.450
Why don't you have a drink?

08:37.730 --> 08:38.580
Huh?

08:38.990 --> 08:40.770
U-Um...

08:42.310 --> 08:43.990
Please forgive me!

08:43.990 --> 08:46.500
So I was right. It's poisoned.

08:46.500 --> 08:47.830
My sister...

08:48.190 --> 08:51.340
They took my younger sister 
hostage... I had to...

08:51.340 --> 08:53.360
What kind of poison did you use?

08:53.360 --> 08:55.660
I was told that one drop 
would be a lethal dose...

08:56.330 --> 08:58.800
and I put in five drops every time.

08:58.800 --> 09:01.210
<i>I really should have picked up on that.</i>

09:01.210 --> 09:04.100
<i>No matter how bottomless my HP is...</i>

09:04.630 --> 09:07.750
And you were also the one who led 
the assassins to the academy?

09:07.750 --> 09:09.290
Y-Yes.

09:09.290 --> 09:10.860
Who ordered you to?

09:11.480 --> 09:15.740
The master. Your father, Count Dolkness.

09:16.380 --> 09:20.520
Well, it did occur to me 
that it might have been him.

09:21.220 --> 09:23.500
What's this about your 
sister being a hostage?

09:23.500 --> 09:28.260
She works at your father's 
mansion in the capital.

09:28.260 --> 09:30.250
Please, just spare my sister...

09:30.250 --> 09:33.640
All right. I'm going to go get your sister.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.160
Come with me.

09:36.850 --> 09:40.640
Where is the Dolkness mansion, 
anyway? I've never been there.

09:40.640 --> 09:43.770
Over there, on the right side of that street.

09:47.530 --> 09:49.400
Do you know where your sister is?

09:49.400 --> 09:53.170
Normally, she'd be finished with 
her work and back in her room.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.090
All right. Let's go.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.660
Sara!

10:00.880 --> 10:02.210
Sister?

10:03.160 --> 10:05.710
Thank goodness you're all right!

10:05.710 --> 10:07.660
Huh? What are you talking about?

10:07.930 --> 10:11.170
Oh... Is that Miss Yumiella?

10:11.460 --> 10:15.420
Yes. You were being held 
hostage by my parents.

10:15.690 --> 10:19.420
Rita said that if she didn't 
kill me, they'd kill you.

10:19.420 --> 10:23.960
I'm sorry, Sara. I have to say 
goodbye. Thank you for everything.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.680
Huh?

10:24.920 --> 10:28.160
My lady, I will assume full 
responsibility for this.

10:28.160 --> 10:30.560
Please just spare my sister.

10:30.560 --> 10:33.070
<i>When did the story get to that point?</i>

10:33.350 --> 10:36.830
Do it quickly, in a place where 
she can't see it, if possible.

10:36.830 --> 10:39.560
Wait, wait, wait. I'm not a demon.

10:39.560 --> 10:40.450
Huh?

10:40.850 --> 10:43.600
I have no intention of punishing you.

10:43.600 --> 10:45.590
You were being threatened.

10:45.590 --> 10:49.230
If I suffered any harm, it was 
that the tea wasn't very good.

10:49.850 --> 10:54.960
My lady... no, Miss Yumiella, I will 
be loyal to you until the day I die.

10:54.960 --> 10:57.710
Uh... Okay. Thanks.

10:57.710 --> 11:00.470
There's something I need to do. Wait here.

11:00.760 --> 11:01.890
Okay...

11:09.370 --> 11:10.600
Good evening.

11:11.830 --> 11:12.730
Who are you?

11:12.730 --> 11:15.980
Oh, should I have said "I'm home" instead?

11:16.200 --> 11:17.420
"Home"?

11:17.420 --> 11:19.550
You... It can't be...

11:19.550 --> 11:23.240
It's a pleasure to finally 
meet you, Father, Mother.

11:23.620 --> 11:26.990
I'm your only daughter, Yumiella.

11:26.990 --> 11:32.590
The same Yumiella Dolkness you tried to use 
for a political marriage and then kill.

11:33.890 --> 11:36.080
<i>Now that I've met them, I realize that</i>

11:36.080 --> 11:38.630
<i>I don't actually detest my parents that much.</i>

11:38.930 --> 11:41.580
<i>Of course, I'd say they're 
not the greatest parents,</i>

11:41.580 --> 11:45.390
<i>but if they'd spoiled me throughout 
my childhood, I wouldn't be who I am.</i>

11:45.750 --> 11:49.270
Damn those losers! I paid 
them a lot of money, too!

11:49.270 --> 11:52.230
So you admit that you tried to kill me?

11:52.230 --> 11:55.400
This all started because <i>you</i> betrayed us!

11:55.640 --> 11:58.170
What do you mean, I "betrayed" you?

11:58.170 --> 12:03.030
I know you've been working with the 
king's faction to prepare for war!

12:03.370 --> 12:04.850
Prepare for war?

12:04.850 --> 12:07.620
Yes! I know you're in on it!

12:07.840 --> 12:12.850
You stole the plan that we of the 
anti-king faction came up with!

12:12.850 --> 12:17.630
We've been deeply shamed because 
you took our enemy's side!

12:18.020 --> 12:20.760
<i>Ah... I'm starting to see what's going on.</i>

12:21.650 --> 12:26.010
<i>The kingdom is preparing its military 
for the Demon Lord's invasion.</i>

12:26.010 --> 12:30.630
<i>The extremists must have mistaken that as 
preparation for war with another country.</i>

12:31.290 --> 12:36.450
<i>They fear that this dispatch of troops 
will empower the king's faction.</i>

12:37.020 --> 12:39.780
<i>The king has taken a liking to me,</i>

12:39.780 --> 12:43.280
<i>and I've refused all proposals 
from the anti-king faction.</i>

12:43.540 --> 12:46.910
<i>So my parents thought assassinating 
me would be better</i>

12:46.910 --> 12:49.040
<i>than handing me over to the enemy.</i>

12:49.040 --> 12:50.770
<i>That must be it.</i>

12:51.410 --> 12:53.600
There is no war with any other nation.

12:53.600 --> 12:56.900
I have no intention of taking part 
in any strategic war, either.

12:56.900 --> 12:57.800
Why?!

12:57.800 --> 13:01.670
If you earned fame in battle, the Dolkness 
family would earn a central position!

13:01.670 --> 13:05.040
We wouldn't be ridiculed as 
"wannabe central nobles" anymore!

13:05.040 --> 13:07.760
Father, why don't you return to our domain?

13:08.310 --> 13:11.880
It may be a good idea to start 
some sort of undertaking there.

13:11.880 --> 13:15.360
Don't be ridiculous. I've left my 
administrator in charge of the domain.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.900
All we need to do there is collect taxes.

13:17.210 --> 13:18.740
What about you, Mother?

13:18.740 --> 13:21.190
You expect me to live in the countryside?

13:21.190 --> 13:23.480
It's bad enough that you have black hair!

13:23.480 --> 13:25.530
Why did I have to have a child like you?!

13:25.920 --> 13:27.890
<i>These two are hopeless.</i>

13:27.890 --> 13:30.960
<i>I never had any hope in them 
as parents to begin with,</i>

13:30.960 --> 13:34.660
<i>but they're hopeless both 
as nobles and as humans.</i>

13:35.250 --> 13:38.260
Father, yield your title to me.

13:38.260 --> 13:39.170
What are you—

13:39.430 --> 13:43.620
You're free to refuse.
I'm your only heir, after all.

13:43.620 --> 13:47.530
When you die, I will 
automatically become a countess.

13:48.860 --> 13:51.010
S-Someone call the guards!

13:51.010 --> 13:53.680
You think there are any 
guards who can best me?

13:53.680 --> 13:55.390
Are you threatening your father?!

13:55.610 --> 13:59.560
I don't need that from someone who 
sent assassins after his own child.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.150
Y-Yumiella...

14:01.150 --> 14:04.170
You have received many 
wonderful marriage offers.

14:04.170 --> 14:06.900
You'll be happy if you marry 
into an important family.

14:06.900 --> 14:09.300
I'm plenty happy already.

14:09.300 --> 14:11.280
But you have black hair.

14:11.540 --> 14:13.910
There's no way you can be happy!

14:14.390 --> 14:18.160
There are people who say 
they like my black hair.

14:18.160 --> 14:21.650
You don't get to decide whether 
I can or can't be happy.

14:23.510 --> 14:24.730
Black Hole.

14:26.950 --> 14:31.630
Choose. House arrest, or an 
honorable death here and now?

14:32.980 --> 14:35.380
<i>Not that I actually intend to kill them.</i>

14:37.860 --> 14:40.290
Well? What will it be?

14:41.700 --> 14:43.770
Okay! We'll do as you say!

14:44.130 --> 14:46.120
Just don't kill us, please!

14:48.900 --> 14:50.280
I understand what's going on.

14:50.930 --> 14:52.300
This must have been hard on you.

14:53.270 --> 14:57.040
But what change of heart persuaded you 
to suggest taking over your domain?

14:57.970 --> 15:01.170
I want to do away with discrimination 
against those with black hair.

15:01.490 --> 15:06.300
I felt the best way to do that would 
be to act from a very visible position.

15:06.700 --> 15:10.460
I see. Your path will be 
lined with thorns, though.

15:10.460 --> 15:12.420
The discrimination might not end right away,

15:12.420 --> 15:14.430
but I'd be satisfied just to lessen it a bit.

15:15.010 --> 15:19.070
In the same way that Prince 
Edwin overcame his prejudice.

15:21.820 --> 15:24.780
There's one thing I learned from all this.

15:24.780 --> 15:27.940
I don't think I have it 
in me to kill someone.

15:27.940 --> 15:29.500
I'd say not.

15:29.500 --> 15:31.250
You spared your parents,

15:31.250 --> 15:34.060
and you even captured those 
assassins instead of killing them.

15:34.060 --> 15:36.830
I've achieved the greatest 
strength a human can attain,

15:36.830 --> 15:39.200
but I guess I still have a human heart.

15:39.860 --> 15:42.710
I worried about that at 
times, so this was a relief.

15:42.990 --> 15:46.790
I always thought you were 
more human than anyone else.

15:47.190 --> 15:50.430
Still, I'm impressed by your 
resolve to become a countess.

15:50.780 --> 15:53.550
Yes, all thanks to a certain boy.

15:53.550 --> 15:55.850
A boy?! What boy?!

15:55.850 --> 15:57.600
A kid around ten years old.

15:58.140 --> 16:00.300
He felt inferior because of his dark hair,

16:00.300 --> 16:02.100
and he was all alone.

16:02.440 --> 16:05.090
Ten years old... I get it.

16:05.090 --> 16:08.910
That made me think I had to 
change society as we know it.

16:08.910 --> 16:11.630
I know there are many 
people who are struggling.

16:11.630 --> 16:14.360
In that case, I'll do whatever I can to help.

16:14.780 --> 16:17.870
Thank you. There's something I 
wanted to ask you regarding that...

16:18.180 --> 16:19.620
Wh-What?

16:19.620 --> 16:22.490
My level may be high,

16:22.490 --> 16:26.750
but I don't know much about the world, 
so I need someone at my side to help me.

16:26.750 --> 16:31.930
Now that I'm a countess, I need to 
think about my successor, too.

16:31.930 --> 16:35.260
S-Successor... Yeah, I guess so.

16:35.470 --> 16:38.260
So... Would you be my...

16:39.130 --> 16:39.800
Yeah?

16:40.360 --> 16:41.550
Would you be...

16:42.020 --> 16:43.710
my adopted son?

16:43.710 --> 16:44.700
Flump!

16:44.700 --> 16:47.520
You're a second son, so you don't need 
to inherit your household, right?

16:47.520 --> 16:49.270
You are <i>not</i> adopting me!

16:49.510 --> 16:50.540
Oh...

16:50.910 --> 16:54.530
I thought it'd be nice if 
you and I became family...

16:54.800 --> 16:56.700
But I guess you don't want to, huh?

16:56.700 --> 16:58.510
That's not what I'm saying!

16:58.510 --> 17:00.040
Well, then, why...

17:00.360 --> 17:01.410
Oh, I see!

17:01.670 --> 17:04.650
Don't worry. I'll retire really early.

17:04.650 --> 17:07.180
I won't pick on your wife or anything.

17:11.350 --> 17:14.140
<i>The seasons changed, and the 
time of the harvest came.</i>

17:14.140 --> 17:17.160
<i>The Kingdom of Valschein's 
Foundation Day Festival was held,</i>

17:17.160 --> 17:20.810
<i>and the king took the opportunity to 
announce the Demon Lord's impending return.</i>

17:21.300 --> 17:24.810
The Demon Lord of the past will soon return.

17:25.380 --> 17:30.530
When he does, he will surely direct his 
army of monsters to invade our kingdom.

17:31.420 --> 17:33.150
But there is no cause for concern.

17:33.150 --> 17:37.200
We have already made all the preparations 
necessary for his return.

17:37.880 --> 17:39.850
My knight captain, Adolf,

17:39.850 --> 17:43.450
will serve as our army's supreme 
commander against the monsters.

17:43.830 --> 17:47.790
And the second prince, Edwin, 
will lead a small, elite force

17:48.030 --> 17:50.570
to fight and defeat the Demon Lord.

17:55.660 --> 17:58.680
<i>The time has finally come 
for me to take center stage.</i>

17:59.280 --> 18:03.330
<i>But if this lessens the discrimination 
against black-haired people at all,</i>

18:03.330 --> 18:05.180
<i>it might not be so bad.</i>

18:06.700 --> 18:08.330
There you are.

18:08.330 --> 18:10.950
Patrick? What are you doing here?

18:10.950 --> 18:13.690
I saw you from the window, so I came down.

18:13.690 --> 18:16.690
I'm impressed you spotted 
me from that far away.

18:17.000 --> 18:18.330
You noticed, huh?

18:18.710 --> 18:20.970
The truth is, I made it to level 60.

18:20.970 --> 18:22.700
I can see things farther away now.

18:22.920 --> 18:26.960
Level 60? That's the same as Captain Adolf!

18:27.180 --> 18:31.460
Exactly. I was going to keep it 
secret for a while longer, but...

18:31.460 --> 18:34.900
Oh... So the reason you've been 
away from the academy so much...

18:34.900 --> 18:37.590
I've been going into dungeons 
whenever I had time.

18:38.040 --> 18:40.760
The Amulet of Growth did the rest.

18:40.760 --> 18:44.260
Hang on! That's dangerous without 
an Amulet of Protection!

18:44.260 --> 18:48.020
Nope. You're the one who 
told me I should use this.

18:48.020 --> 18:51.160
I know, but you still shouldn't!

18:51.160 --> 18:53.270
If anything happened to you, I'd...

18:53.270 --> 18:58.400
That's exactly how I felt every 
time you did something reckless.

18:58.810 --> 19:01.910
I'm... sorry.

19:02.540 --> 19:05.160
I'll try to be less reckless from now on.

19:05.160 --> 19:07.710
I'm glad you understand.

19:08.900 --> 19:12.700
<i>What have I done that was reckless, though?</i>

19:13.030 --> 19:13.960
Yumiella...

19:14.780 --> 19:16.120
I have a favor to ask.

19:16.120 --> 19:18.960
Would you let me join you 
in fighting the Demon Lord?

19:18.960 --> 19:20.410
I can't.

19:20.410 --> 19:22.300
So I'm still not strong enough?

19:22.300 --> 19:23.570
It's not that.

19:23.570 --> 19:27.930
I think your strengths would be best 
utilized in large group combat.

19:27.930 --> 19:31.280
So I'd like you to fight 
against the army of monsters.

19:31.280 --> 19:33.940
I won't be able to help there.

19:34.210 --> 19:37.240
I see... Okay.

19:37.820 --> 19:38.820
Also...

19:38.820 --> 19:42.440
Do you know what they call the man 
and woman who defeat the Demon Lord?

19:42.440 --> 19:45.340
Yeah. The hero and the saint.

19:45.670 --> 19:48.790
If you want to start a new nation with me,

19:48.790 --> 19:50.710
then sure, we could fight together.

19:51.030 --> 19:53.210
Nah, I definitely don't want that.

19:53.490 --> 19:57.460
If you want to become queen, though, 
I don't mind helping you out.

19:57.460 --> 19:59.460
You know I don't want that.

19:59.770 --> 20:00.840
I sure do.

20:01.090 --> 20:04.840
Why were you in such a 
hurry to raise your level?

20:04.840 --> 20:07.220
To be ready for the Demon Lord's return?

20:07.220 --> 20:08.860
Because you...

20:08.860 --> 20:10.100
I what?

20:10.740 --> 20:12.980
I... wanted to be even stronger than you.

20:13.230 --> 20:14.480
But why?

20:14.480 --> 20:18.820
Oh, because losing to me in class 
all the time was upsetting you?

20:18.820 --> 20:22.390
But you know, a person's strength 
isn't all that gives them value.

20:22.990 --> 20:25.990
Remember what you said to that 
guy who asked you to dance?

20:26.460 --> 20:29.320
That you're only into men 
who are stronger than you.

20:29.320 --> 20:30.040
Huh?

20:34.120 --> 20:38.570
Um... I just made that up as 
an excuse to turn him down.

20:35.230 --> 20:41.630
<b>The Hidden Boss Is Confessed To</b>

20:38.570 --> 20:41.630
I don't actually feel that way.

20:42.280 --> 20:44.880
I figured that was probably the case.

20:44.880 --> 20:48.020
I just thought... if I 
wanted to be by your side,

20:48.020 --> 20:50.620
I'd need to be strong enough.

20:52.860 --> 20:54.810
It's almost time for the fireworks.

20:55.530 --> 20:58.840
Hey, Patrick... Let's 
play rock-paper-scissors.

20:58.840 --> 20:59.520
Huh?

20:59.520 --> 21:02.030
Here. Rock, paper, scissors...

21:02.030 --> 21:03.020
Shoot.

21:03.780 --> 21:07.530
Where'd this come from? It's so 
dark, I can't even tell who won.

21:07.770 --> 21:12.040
You did. Looks like you're better 
than me at rock-paper-scissors.

21:12.830 --> 21:16.970
I guess I really do only like 
people who are stronger than me.

21:27.450 --> 21:31.430
Patrick... the thing about it being 
too dark to see was a lie, wasn't it?

21:35.930 --> 21:37.570
<i>As the new school year began,</i>

21:37.570 --> 21:41.190
<i>the invasion by the Demon Lord's 
monster army was confirmed.</i>

21:41.190 --> 21:43.570
<i>At last, the Demon Lord was back.</i>

21:43.980 --> 21:49.070
<i>High-level students from the Royal Academy 
were chosen to join the military.</i>

21:49.070 --> 21:51.100
<i>There were more than anyone expected,</i>

21:51.100 --> 21:53.830
<i>most likely because they had 
been leveling up so efficiently.</i>

21:54.450 --> 21:58.780
<i>Of course, this one had dismal scores 
in magic, so she's staying behind.</i>

21:59.750 --> 22:03.970
<i>And we of the punitive force headed 
for the Demon Lord's stronghold.</i>

22:05.750 --> 22:07.470
<i>The final battle is at hand.</i>
